WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:05.000 --> 00:00:09.600
LADIES AND GENTLEMEN AT THIS
TIME PLEASE RISE FOR THE

00:00:09.600 --> 00:00:14.700
PRESENTATION OF THE COLORS BY
THE MIT HONOR GUARD AND REMAIN

00:00:14.700 --> 00:01:16.067
STANDING FOR THE CONCERT CHOIR
IN SINGING THE NATIONAL ANTHEM.

00:01:16.067 --> 00:02:13.500
♪
♪ O SAY CAN YOU SEE BY THE

00:02:13.500 --> 00:02:29.233
DAWN'S EARLY LIGHT ♪
♪ WHAT SO PROUDLY WE HAILED AT

00:02:29.233 --> 00:02:37.033
THE TWILIGHT'S LAST GLEAMING ♪
♪ WHOSE BROAD STRIPES AND

00:02:37.033 --> 00:02:42.900
BRIGHT STARS THROUGH THE
PERILOUS FIGHT ♪

00:02:42.900 --> 00:02:56.233
♪ O'ER THE RAMPARTS WE WATCHED
WERE SO GALLANTLY STREAMING ♪

00:02:56.233 --> 00:03:07.700
♪ AND THE ROCKETS RED GLARE ♪
♪ THE BOMBS BURSTING IN AIR ♪

00:03:07.700 --> 00:03:21.433
♪ GAVE PROOF THROUGH THE NIGHT ♪
♪ THAT THE FLAG WAS STILL THERE

00:03:21.433 --> 00:03:36.767
♪ O SAY DOES THAT STAR-SPANGLED
BANNER YET WAVE ♪

00:03:36.767 --> 00:04:56.833
♪ O'ER THE LAND OF THE FREE ♪
♪ AND THE HOME OF THE BRAVE ♪ ♪

00:04:56.833 --> 00:05:02.067
PLEASE BE SEATED.

00:05:02.067 --> 00:05:06.100
GOOD MORNING AND WELCOME TO THE
DEDICATION OF THE MEMORIAL TO

00:05:06.100 --> 00:05:10.067
MIT POLICE OFFICER SEAN COLLIER,
BADGE 179.

00:05:10.067 --> 00:05:14.033
I AM ISRAEL RUIZ, EXECUTIVE VICE
PRESIDENT AND TREASURER AT MIT.

00:05:14.033 --> 00:05:18.000
IT IS OUR HONOR TO BE JOINED
TODAY BY:

00:05:18.000 --> 00:05:21.867
THE COLLIER AND ROGERS FAMILY;
ATTORNEY GENERAL MAURA HEALEY;

00:05:21.867 --> 00:05:25.833
US ATTORNEY CARMEN ORTIZ;
MIDDLESEX DISTRICT ATTORNEY

00:05:25.833 --> 00:05:29.800
MARIAN RYAN;
AND MANY FRIENDS FROM THE CITY

00:05:29.800 --> 00:05:32.500
OF CAMBRIDGE, INCLUDING MAYOR
DAVID MAHER;

00:05:32.500 --> 00:05:36.467
CITY MANAGER RICH ROSSI;
AND CAMBRIDGE POLICE

00:05:36.467 --> 00:05:40.400
COMMISSIONER BOB HAAS, WHO HAVE
BEEN BY OUR SIDE EVERY STEP OF

00:05:40.400 --> 00:05:41.233
THE WAY.

00:05:41.233 --> 00:05:43.433
IT IS A PRIVILEGE TO HAVE WITH
US:

00:05:43.433 --> 00:05:44.767
CITY COUNCILORS...

00:05:44.767 --> 00:05:48.733
LELAND CHEUNG
CRAIG KELLEY

00:05:48.733 --> 00:05:51.300
NADEEM MAZEN
MARC MCGOVERN

00:05:51.300 --> 00:05:53.267
AND TIM TOOMEY.

00:05:53.267 --> 00:05:57.233
I WOULD ALSO LIKE TO WELCOME
MASSACHUSETTS STATE COLONEL

00:05:57.233 --> 00:06:01.200
TIMOTHY ALBEN AND THE ALL
MEMBERS OF LAW ENFORCEMENT

00:06:01.200 --> 00:06:05.233
AGENCIES JOINING US IN SUPPORT
AND FRIENDSHIP.

00:06:05.233 --> 00:06:09.100
TO THE MEMBERS OF THE MIT
COMMUNITY: WE HAVE STOOD STRONG

00:06:09.100 --> 00:06:13.067
IN THE TWO YEARS SINCE WE LOST
OFFICER COLLIER ON THAT TRAGIC

00:06:13.067 --> 00:06:15.067
NIGHT IN APRIL 2013.

00:06:15.067 --> 00:06:19.000
TODAY, WE GATHER TO REMEMBER
OFFICER COLLIER AND TO THANK THE

00:06:19.000 --> 00:06:22.967
COLLIER MEMORIAL PROJECT TEAM,
AND THE MEMORIAL COMMITTEE

00:06:22.967 --> 00:06:26.933
CO-CHAIRED BY CHIEF JOHN DIFAVA
AND PROVOST MARTY SCHMIDT, ALL

00:06:26.933 --> 00:06:30.900
OF WHOM PERSEVERED THROUGH THE
WINTER WITH VISION, COMMITMENT,

00:06:30.900 --> 00:06:34.867
AND TIRELESS EFFORT TO BRING US
TO THIS DAY.

00:06:34.867 --> 00:06:38.800
YOU WILL FIND THE LIST OF
CONTRIBUTORS IN YOUR PROGRAM,

00:06:38.800 --> 00:06:42.767
BUT PLEASE ALLOW ME TO THANK A
FEW INDIVIDUALS.

00:06:42.767 --> 00:06:46.733
THE MIT COMMUNITY IS ENORMOUSLY
GRATEFUL TO PROFESSOR MEEJIN

00:06:46.733 --> 00:06:50.700
YOON, HEAD OF MIT'S DEPARTMENT
OF ARCHITECTURE FOR HER IMMENSE

00:06:50.700 --> 00:06:54.667
CREATIVITY, SENSITIVITY, AND
LEADERSHIP, AND TO THE WHOLE

00:06:54.667 --> 00:06:56.633
DESIGN TEAM AT HÖWELER AND YOON.

00:06:56.633 --> 00:07:00.600
TO PROFESSOR JOHN OCHSENDORF AND
HIS ENGINEERING COLLEAGUES, WE

00:07:00.600 --> 00:07:04.633
EXPRESS AWE AND GRATITUDE FOR
THE ARTFULLY PRECISE WORK THAT

00:07:04.633 --> 00:07:08.500
ALLOWED DESIGN TO BECOME
REALITY.

00:07:08.500 --> 00:07:12.467
I WOULD LIKE TO THANK SUFFOLK
CONSTRUCTION AND THE WHOLE TEAM

00:07:12.467 --> 00:07:16.433
OF DEDICATED PROFESSIONALS WHO
SURMOUNTED EXTRAORDINARY

00:07:16.433 --> 00:07:20.400
CHALLENGES OF WEATHER AND
LOGISTICS PRECEDING THIS DAY,

00:07:20.400 --> 00:07:24.367
WITH PARTICULAR APPRECIATION TO
ROB ROGERS, WHO IS BOTH PROJECT

00:07:24.367 --> 00:07:26.333
MANAGER AND SEAN'S
BROTHER...ROB,

00:07:26.333 --> 00:07:30.300
WE ARE PROUD TO HAVE WORKED WITH
YOU.

00:07:30.300 --> 00:07:34.267
AND TO THE MIT PROJECT TEAM, LED
BY RICHARD AMSTER, PAUL MURPHY,

00:07:34.267 --> 00:07:36.233
AND JENNIFER COMBS: THANK YOU.

00:07:36.233 --> 00:07:40.200
YOUR PERSONAL COMMITMENT HAS
MADE IT POSSIBLE TO OPEN THE

00:07:40.200 --> 00:07:42.167
MEMORIAL TO OUR COMMUNITY TODAY.

00:07:42.167 --> 00:07:46.133
THE PERMANENT MEMORIAL IS
INTENDED TO BE A PLACE OF

00:07:46.133 --> 00:07:50.100
REMEMBRANCE AND REFLECTION, A
PLACE THAT EVOKES THE STRENGTH

00:07:50.100 --> 00:07:54.067
OF 'COLLIER STRONG', A PLACE
THAT REFLECTS THE CONNECTEDNESS

00:07:54.067 --> 00:07:58.000
OF OUR COMMUNITY, AND EPITOMIZES
THE HIGHEST EXPRESSION OF OUR

00:07:58.000 --> 00:08:04.467
MIT MOTTO 'MENS ET MANUS' --
MIND AND HAND.

00:08:04.467 --> 00:08:08.367
I KNOW THAT THE MEMORIAL, WITH
ITS POWERFUL DESIGN, WITH WHAT

00:08:08.367 --> 00:08:12.333
IT REPRESENTS AND ALL THAT IT
SIGNIFIES, WILL PROVIDE A PLACE

00:08:12.333 --> 00:08:16.300
WHERE WE CAN GO TO CELEBRATE
OFFICER COLLIER'S LIFE, TO SHARE

00:08:16.300 --> 00:08:21.700
HIS SENSE OF COMMUNITY, TO FEEL
A SENSE OF PROTECTION, A PLACE

00:08:21.700 --> 00:08:25.667
WHERE AN OPEN HAND REMINDS US
THAT WE ARE A COMMUNITY THAT

00:08:25.667 --> 00:08:29.633
STAYS TRUE TO ITS HIGHEST VALUES
AND REACHES OUT TO THOSE IN NEED

00:08:29.633 --> 00:08:33.600
AS OFFICER COLLIER DID, EVEN IN
THE FACE OF THE ULTIMATE THREAT.

00:08:33.600 --> 00:08:37.567
THE COLLIER MEMORIAL AND THE
PEOPLE WHO MADE IT POSSIBLE

00:08:37.567 --> 00:08:41.500
REPRESENT THE BEST EMBODIMENT
AND TRIBUTE TO OFFICER COLLIER'S

00:08:41.500 --> 00:08:43.500
LIFE, AND MAKE MIT VERY PROUD.

00:08:43.500 --> 00:08:47.467
IT IS NOW MY PLEASURE TO
INTRODUCE MIT PRESIDENT, RAFAEL

00:08:47.467 --> 00:08:50.400
REIF.

00:08:50.400 --> 00:09:00.967
[APPLAUSE]

00:09:00.967 --> 00:09:03.967
THANK YOU, ISRAEL.

00:09:03.967 --> 00:09:09.867
SINCE WE LOST OFFICER COLLIER
TWO YEARS AGO, YOU HAVE PLAYED A

00:09:09.867 --> 00:09:15.733
CENTRAL ROLE IN GUIDING OUR
COMMUNITY'S RESPONSE.

00:09:15.733 --> 00:09:21.600
MOST RECENTLY, TOGETHER WITH
YOUR TEAM, YOU OVERSAW THE

00:09:21.600 --> 00:09:27.500
CREATION OF THIS SUPERB
MEMORIAL.

00:09:27.500 --> 00:09:33.367
AND I WANT TO EXPRESS MY
GRATITUDE FOR YOUR INSPIRED

00:09:33.367 --> 00:09:36.300
LEADERSHIP.

00:09:36.300 --> 00:09:42.200
GOOD MORNING, OFFICER COLLIER'S
FAMILY, MAYOR MAHER AND OUR MANY

00:09:42.200 --> 00:09:45.133
DISTINGUISHED GUESTS.

00:09:45.133 --> 00:09:51.000
PROFESSOR YOON, PROFESSOR
OCHSENDORF AND THE ENTIRE

00:09:51.000 --> 00:09:53.967
MEMORIAL TEAM.

00:09:53.967 --> 00:09:59.833
CHIEF DIFAVA...AND SEAN'S
COUNTLESS FRIENDS AND ADMIRERS,

00:09:59.833 --> 00:10:02.767
IN AND OUT OF UNIFORM.

00:10:02.767 --> 00:10:08.667
WE COME TOGETHER AT THE END OF A
LONG WINTER.

00:10:08.667 --> 00:10:14.533
BUT TODAY, IN THE WARMTH OF EACH
OTHER'S COMPANY...AND THROUGH

00:10:14.533 --> 00:10:20.333
THE BRIGHT MEMORY OF SEAN'S
EXAMPLE...I BELIEVE WE HAVE

00:10:20.333 --> 00:10:23.333
FOUND SPRING AT LAST.

00:10:23.333 --> 00:10:27.867
THIS MORNING I WANT TO MAKE TWO
OBSERVATIONS ABOUT THE MEMORIAL

00:10:27.867 --> 00:10:32.967
ITSELF AND WHAT IT EXPRESSES
ABOUT OUR COMMUNITY.

00:10:32.967 --> 00:10:46.833
IN A MOMENT, THE DESIGNER OF THE
MONUMENT, PREFER -- PROFESSOR

00:10:46.833 --> 00:10:49.367
MEEJIN YOON WILL DESCRIBE HOW IT
WAS MADE.

00:10:49.367 --> 00:10:56.833
AND WE WILL HEAR ABOUT THE
IMPULSE, THE INSTINCT TO DO IT

00:10:56.833 --> 00:10:57.533
YOURSELF.

00:10:57.533 --> 00:11:03.667
THIS MEMORIAL WAS DESIGNED AND
ENGINEERED BY A BRILLIANT TEAM

00:11:03.667 --> 00:11:07.767
OF MIT FACULTY STUDENTS AND
STAFF.

00:11:07.767 --> 00:11:11.900
THEY WERE MOVED TO BE A PART OF
THE PROCESS, AND WERE PERSONALLY

00:11:11.900 --> 00:11:13.400
INVESTED IN THE OUTCOME.

00:11:13.400 --> 00:11:21.333
AND IN LEADING THE TEAM FROM
SUFFOLK CONSTRUCTION, SEAN'S

00:11:21.333 --> 00:11:24.367
BROTHER, ROB, MADE EVERYONE FEEL
LIKE FAMILY.

00:11:24.367 --> 00:11:31.667
THIS WAS NOT A PROJECT PRODUCED
AT THE REQUEST OF A PATRON.

00:11:31.667 --> 00:11:36.600
INSTEAD IT WAS AN OFFERING
INTENDED FOR ALL OF US.

00:11:36.600 --> 00:11:43.733
AN EXPLORATION OF THEMES AND
FORMS AND EMOTIONS AND MEMORIES,

00:11:43.733 --> 00:11:46.600
MATERIALS AND FORCES.

00:11:46.600 --> 00:11:58.033
A CREATIVE EXPERIMENT FORMED BY
OUR COMMUNITY AND FOR OUR

00:11:58.033 --> 00:12:00.567
COMMUNITY.

00:12:00.567 --> 00:12:03.333
IT WAS AN ACT OF TRANSFORMATION.

00:12:03.333 --> 00:12:07.600
MIT IS KNOWN FOR SCIENCE AND
TECHNOLOGY, DISCOVERY AND

00:12:07.600 --> 00:12:09.800
INNOVATION.

00:12:09.800 --> 00:12:12.833
BOLDNESS AND DARING.

00:12:12.833 --> 00:12:18.533
TODAY THROUGH THIS MEMORIAL WE
DEMONSTRATE ALL OF THOSE

00:12:18.533 --> 00:12:23.300
STRENGTHS AND WE REMIND
OURSELVES OF OUR CAPACITY FOR

00:12:23.300 --> 00:12:28.100
REVERENCE AND BEAUTY TOO.

00:12:28.100 --> 00:12:32.667
WE ARE A COMMUNITY OF MAKERS,
AND WE USE THAT POWER TO MAKE

00:12:32.667 --> 00:12:36.667
THINGS KNOWN.

00:12:36.667 --> 00:12:43.767
A SECOND OBSERVATION, AS WE WILL
HEAR THE STONE ARTIST OF THE

00:12:43.767 --> 00:12:57.633
MEMORIAL ARE HELD TOGETHER NOT
WITH MORTAR OR FASTENERS BUT

00:12:57.633 --> 00:13:00.067
SHEER FAITH IN THE POWER OF
PHYSICS.

00:13:00.067 --> 00:13:04.133
THOSE ARE FORCES THAT WE
UNDERSTAND VERY WELL AT MIT, AND

00:13:04.133 --> 00:13:07.033
MOST TIMES AND PLACES.

00:13:07.033 --> 00:13:10.167
THESE FORCES ARE INVISIBLE.

00:13:10.167 --> 00:13:15.533
BUT THIS MEMORIAL REVEALS THEM
TO THE WORLD BY DISPLAYING THEIR

00:13:15.533 --> 00:13:19.867
POWER IN ACTION.

00:13:19.867 --> 00:13:25.433
TWO YEARS AGO AS WE FIRST
MOURNED OFFICER COLLIER, THE

00:13:25.433 --> 00:13:28.600
MEMBERS OF OUR COMMUNITY CAME
TOGETHER WITH INCREDIBLE

00:13:28.600 --> 00:13:32.933
STRENGTH, MORE THAN WE HAD
UNDERSTOOD WAS POSSIBLE.

00:13:32.933 --> 00:13:46.700
WE CAME TOGETHER IN DEEP
SYMPATHY FOR SEAN'S FAMILY AND

00:13:46.700 --> 00:13:54.567
POLICE AND FIRST RESPONDERS
AND EMPATHY FOR EVERYONE

00:13:54.567 --> 00:13:57.367
THAT ENDURED THE TRAUMA OF THE
BOSTON BOMBINGS.

00:13:57.367 --> 00:14:01.733
WE SAW COURAGE AND GENEROSITY
AND ENDURANCE, QUALITIES ALWAYS

00:14:01.733 --> 00:14:05.700
THERE BUT NOT USUALLY REVEALED.

00:14:05.700 --> 00:14:09.633
UNTIL WE ALL UNDERSTOOD WHAT IT
MEANT TO BE COLLIER STRONG.

00:14:09.633 --> 00:14:16.033
IN EFFECT, WE SAW THEN THAT WE
ARE HELD TOGETHER BY INVISIBLE

00:14:16.033 --> 00:14:17.500
FORCES TOO.

00:14:17.500 --> 00:14:22.967
THE TRAGEDY OF SEAN'S LOSS MADE
THOSE FORCES VISIBLE AND MADE

00:14:22.967 --> 00:14:26.567
THEM STRONGER.

00:14:26.567 --> 00:14:31.733
BEGINNING TODAY, THIS MEMORIAL
WILL BE A LANDMARK IN OUR DAILY

00:14:31.733 --> 00:14:32.900
LIVES.

00:14:32.900 --> 00:14:36.167
AND A GATEWAY TO THE CAMPUS WE
SHARE.

00:14:36.167 --> 00:14:42.700
AND I HOPE THAT IN ITS GRACEFUL
DISPLAY OF INVISIBLE PHYSICAL

00:14:42.700 --> 00:14:49.500
FORCES, IT CAN BECOME A DAILY
REMINDER OF THOSE INVISIBLE

00:14:49.500 --> 00:14:53.933
HUMAN FORCES THAT CREATE
COMMUNITY.

00:14:53.933 --> 00:15:01.600
I HOPE IT CAN SERVE AS A GATEWAY
TO THE KNOWLEDGE OF

00:15:01.600 --> 00:15:05.133
EXTRAORDINARY THINGS WE CAN
ACHIEVE IF WE CAN SEE AND FEEL

00:15:05.133 --> 00:15:08.800
AND DRAW ON THAT POWER TOGETHER.

00:15:08.800 --> 00:15:14.667
WITHOUT CALAMITY TO CONFRONT
OTHER CHALLENGES FOR EACH OTHER,

00:15:14.667 --> 00:15:21.067
FOR OUR COMMUNITY, OUR CITY, OUR
NATION, OUR WORLD.

00:15:21.067 --> 00:15:27.667
WE DEDICATE THIS MEMORIAL TO A
YOUNG MAN WHO BY THE JOYFUL WAY

00:15:27.667 --> 00:15:33.900
HE LIVED SHOWED US WHAT IT MEANS
TO BE ONE MIT, AND ONE

00:15:33.900 --> 00:15:35.667
COMMUNITY.

00:15:35.667 --> 00:15:42.200
TODAY INSPIRED BY HIS EXAMPLE,
MAY WE FIND THAT THE POWER TO

00:15:42.200 --> 00:15:48.100
ENDURE TOGETHER HAS BECOME THE
POWER TO HEAL, TO GATHER OUR

00:15:48.100 --> 00:15:54.433
FORCES AND TO BEGIN TO GROW
AGAIN.

00:15:54.433 --> 00:15:59.433
NOW FOR A PERSPECTIVE FROM OUR
COMMENDED COMMUNITY, IT IS NOW

00:15:59.433 --> 00:16:03.000
MY PLEASURE TO INTRODUCE OUR
GOOD FRIEND AND NEIGHBOR, THE

00:16:03.000 --> 00:16:06.767
MAYOR OF THE CITY OF CAMBRIDGE,
DAVID MAHER.

00:16:06.767 --> 00:16:15.800
[APPLAUSE]

00:16:15.800 --> 00:16:22.433
PRESIDENT REIF, AND VICE
PRESIDENT RUIZ, AND CHIEF DIFAVA

00:16:22.433 --> 00:16:26.167
AND MEMBERS OF THE COLLIER
FAMILY AND MEMBERS OF THE MIT

00:16:26.167 --> 00:16:27.033
COMMUNITY.

00:16:27.033 --> 00:16:29.433
GOOD AFTERNOON, IT'S AN HONOR TO
BE WITH YOU TODAY.

00:16:29.433 --> 00:16:35.200
ON BEHALF OF MY COLLEAGUES IN
LOCAL GOVERNMENT AND THE

00:16:35.200 --> 00:16:39.433
RESIDENCES OF THE GREAT CITY OF
CAMBRIDGE, I STAND BEFORE YOU

00:16:39.433 --> 00:16:47.000
TODAY TO OFFER OUR CONTINUED
HEART FELT PRAYERS TO SEAN AND

00:16:47.000 --> 00:16:47.900
HIS FAMILY.

00:16:47.900 --> 00:16:53.467
AND TO THE POLICE DEPARTMENT AND
THE COMMUNITY AND TO ALL OFFICER

00:16:53.467 --> 00:16:59.133
COLLIER'S COLLEAGUES IN THE LAW
ENFORCEMENT, AND THE CAMBRIDGE

00:16:59.133 --> 00:17:01.900
POLICE DEPARTMENT AND THE
CAMBRIDGE FIRE DEPARTMENT WITH

00:17:01.900 --> 00:17:02.633
US TODAY.

00:17:02.633 --> 00:17:08.300
A YEAR AGO I HAD THE HONOR OF
MARKING THE ONE YEAR ANNIVERSARY

00:17:08.300 --> 00:17:11.433
OF OFFICER COLLIER'S TRAGIC
PASSING.

00:17:11.433 --> 00:17:14.200
IT'S HARD TO BELIEVE THAT
ANOTHER YEAR HAS PASSED.

00:17:14.200 --> 00:17:17.900
TODAY WE JOIN TOGETHER THE MIT
COMMUNITY, THE CAMBRIDGE

00:17:17.900 --> 00:17:21.267
COMMUNITY, AND THE LARGER
GREATER BOSTON COMMUNITY TO

00:17:21.267 --> 00:17:25.133
HONOR THE MEMORY OF OFFICER SEAN
COLLIER.

00:17:25.133 --> 00:17:30.233
IN THE DAYS AND WEEKS AFTER
OFFICER COLLIER'S DEATH, OUR

00:17:30.233 --> 00:17:34.333
COMMUNITIES DISPLAYED
EXCEPTIONAL COLLABORATION AND

00:17:34.333 --> 00:17:39.533
COOPERATION, SUPPORTING EACH
OTHER AND HELPING EACH OTHER

00:17:39.533 --> 00:17:43.633
THROUGH WHAT WAS AN
EXTRAORDINARY DIFFICULT AND DARK

00:17:43.633 --> 00:17:44.667
PERIOD.

00:17:44.667 --> 00:17:47.500
TODAY THOSE BONDS ARE STRONGER
THAN EVER.

00:17:47.500 --> 00:17:53.967
AS WE DEDICATE THIS MEMORIAL, I
AM DEEPLY MOVED AND IMPRESSED BY

00:17:53.967 --> 00:17:58.267
MIT'S DEPARTMENT OF
ARCHITECTURE, THE COLLIER

00:17:58.267 --> 00:18:00.867
MEMORIAL COMMITTEE AND THE
DESIGN AND CONSTRUCTION TEAMS.

00:18:00.867 --> 00:18:04.567
THIS DEDICATED GROUP OF
INDIVIDUALS COMMITTED THEMSELVES

00:18:04.567 --> 00:18:08.433
TO HONORING AND REMEMBERING
OFFICER COLLIER'S LIFE IN HIS

00:18:08.433 --> 00:18:10.033
LASTING LEGACY.

00:18:10.033 --> 00:18:14.500
THE MEMORIAL COMMITTEE AND THE
ARCHITECTS AND THE MIT COMMUNITY

00:18:14.500 --> 00:18:18.167
HAVE FOUND A PERMANENT AND
FITTING WAY TO CAPTURE WHAT IS

00:18:18.167 --> 00:18:23.733
COMMONLY REFERRED TO AS COLLIER
STRONG IN THIS BEAUTIFUL

00:18:23.733 --> 00:18:25.167
MEMORIAL.

00:18:25.167 --> 00:18:27.333
EMPHASIZING STRENGTH AND UNITY.

00:18:27.333 --> 00:18:31.800
THE DEDICATION OF THIS MEMORIAL
ENSURES THAT OFFICER COLLIER'S

00:18:31.800 --> 00:18:33.900
MEMORY WILL NEVER BE FORGOTTEN.

00:18:33.900 --> 00:18:38.367
THIS MEMORIAL WILL SERVE AS A
SYMBOL OF STRENGTH, COURAGE,

00:18:38.367 --> 00:18:40.367
SERVICE AND DEDICATION.

00:18:40.367 --> 00:18:45.633
ALL QUALITIES THAT SEAN EMBODIED
BOTH AS A POLICE OFFICER, AND

00:18:45.633 --> 00:18:48.600
MORE IMPORTANTLY AS A HUMAN
BEING.

00:18:48.600 --> 00:18:54.333
THE DESIGN OF THE MEMORIAL
SYMBOLIZES HOW WE ARE UNITED AS

00:18:54.333 --> 00:18:55.267
ONE COMMUNITY.

00:18:55.267 --> 00:19:05.967
THE WALLS SEEMINGLY REACH OUT
BEYOND THE MIT CAMPUS TO THE

00:19:05.967 --> 00:19:07.633
CAMBRIDGE COMMUNITY AS ONE.

00:19:07.633 --> 00:19:13.667
MEMORIAL SERVES AS A PERMANENT
WAY TO REMEMBER OFFICER COLLIER

00:19:13.667 --> 00:19:17.367
A TRIBUTE TO A LIFE OF SERVICE,
DEDICATION AND SACRIFICE.

00:19:17.367 --> 00:19:23.033
THE SHEER SIZE AND IMPOSING
DESIGN OF THE MEMORIAL ENSURE

00:19:23.033 --> 00:19:25.667
THAT ALL WHO PASS BY THIS SITE.

00:19:25.667 --> 00:19:31.367
WHETHER THIS WEEK OR DAYS FROM
NOW OR DECADES FROM NOW, KNOW

00:19:31.367 --> 00:19:35.133
WHO OFFICER COLLIER WAS AND THE
SPIRIT HE EMBODIED.

00:19:35.133 --> 00:19:38.733
THOUGH WE WILL NEVER FORGET THE
TRAGIC EVENTS OF TWO YEARS AGO,

00:19:38.733 --> 00:19:42.033
THIS MEMORIAL SERVES AS A
REMINDER OF GOOD.

00:19:42.033 --> 00:19:47.367
A REMINDER OF AN EXTRAORDINARY
YOUNG MAN WHO WAS FULL OF LIFE

00:19:47.367 --> 00:19:50.333
AND LOVE AND COMMITTED TO
SERVING OTHERS.

00:19:50.333 --> 00:19:55.533
IN CLOSING I WANT TO THANK THE
MIT COMMUNITY AND THE COLLIER

00:19:55.533 --> 00:19:55.900
FAMILY.

00:19:55.900 --> 00:20:00.733
AND I WANT YOU ALL TO KNOW THAT
THE CITY OF CAMBRIDGE AND OUR

00:20:00.733 --> 00:20:03.500
RESIDENTS CONTINUE TO STAND WITH
YOU AND CONTINUE TO BE INSPIRED

00:20:03.500 --> 00:20:05.767
BY YOUR STRENGTH AND GRACE.

00:20:05.767 --> 00:20:06.433
THANK YOU.

00:20:06.433 --> 00:20:30.633
[APPLAUSE]

00:20:30.633 --> 00:20:34.800
HERE WE ARE
A CONVERGENCE OF SEEKERS,

00:20:34.800 --> 00:20:37.500
SERVERS, SPEAKERS, MAKERS.

00:20:37.500 --> 00:20:42.867
ALONE WE CARRY INDIVIDUAL
FLAMES; TOGETHER WE BECOME A

00:20:42.867 --> 00:20:48.233
RADIANT CONSTELLATION HONORING
SEAN COLLIER.

00:20:48.233 --> 00:20:53.633
FOR MANY OF US, SEAN WAS A
SOURCE OF LIGHT, A SOURCE OF

00:20:53.633 --> 00:20:56.333
WARMTH.

00:20:56.333 --> 00:21:01.700
HE TALKED TO US, HIKED WITH US,
DANCED WITH US.

00:21:01.700 --> 00:21:04.467
HE WAS ALWAYS AMONG US.

00:21:04.467 --> 00:21:07.133
HE STILL IS.

00:21:07.133 --> 00:21:09.833
TAKE A LOOK AROUND.

00:21:09.833 --> 00:21:15.200
WE COME ALSO TO HONOR THE
RECENTLY LOST, FELLOW STUDENTS

00:21:15.200 --> 00:21:20.533
AND FRIENDS, FOR EVERY LOSS
LEAVES A VOID.

00:21:20.533 --> 00:21:25.900
LET OUR PRIVATE SORROWS BECOME
AS PUBLIC AS AIR, AS FUNCTIONAL

00:21:25.900 --> 00:21:28.600
AS GRANITE.

00:21:28.600 --> 00:21:33.967
THE WORLD TELLS US WE ARE
FINITE, BUT OUR INFINITE

00:21:33.967 --> 00:21:39.367
INCLINATIONS WILL TOUCH
MOUNTAINTOPS, OCEAN FLOORS, THE

00:21:39.367 --> 00:21:44.733
EDGE OF THIS WORLD, AND THE
HORIZONS OF HUMAN EXPERIENCE.

00:21:44.733 --> 00:21:47.433
HERE WE ARE NOT ALONE.

00:21:47.433 --> 00:21:52.800
HERE WE LEARNED TO HACK OUR WAY
INTO EACH OTHER'S HEARTS.

00:21:52.800 --> 00:21:58.200
TOGETHER WE STEP OUT OF THE
SHADOWS, EACH OF OUR LIVES ITS

00:21:58.200 --> 00:22:03.633
OWN LIGHT SOURCE, ELEVATING
EVERY LIFE WE TOUCH.

00:22:03.633 --> 00:22:09.000
TWO YEARS AGO WE WERE SHELTERING
IN PLACE; TODAY WE CELEBRATE A

00:22:09.000 --> 00:22:11.700
PLACE OF SHELTER.

00:22:11.700 --> 00:22:14.400
TAKE A LOOK AROUND.

00:22:14.400 --> 00:22:17.100
OPEN HEART.

00:22:17.100 --> 00:22:19.700
OPEN MIND.

00:22:19.700 --> 00:22:22.700
OPEN HAND.

00:22:22.700 --> 00:22:39.333
[APPLAUSE]

00:22:39.333 --> 00:22:45.600
PRESIDENT REIF, AND MEMBERS
OF THE COLLIER AND ROGER FAMILY,

00:22:45.600 --> 00:22:50.833
HONORED GUESTS AND MEMBERS OF
THE MIT FAMILY AND FAMILY AND

00:22:50.833 --> 00:22:51.967
FRIENDS, GOOD AFTERNOON.

00:22:51.967 --> 00:22:57.000
WE HAVE SPOKE A NUMBER OF WORDS
AND CRIED A RIVER OF TEARS, TO

00:22:57.000 --> 00:22:58.733
HONOR SEAN'S MEMORY.

00:22:58.733 --> 00:23:03.033
BUT THERE IS ANOTHER REASON WHY
WE EXPRESS SUCH DEEP AND

00:23:03.033 --> 00:23:08.433
HEART-FELT EMOTION, TO REACH OUT
AND FIND THE COMFORT AND SUPPORT

00:23:08.433 --> 00:23:11.500
WE NEED TO DEAL WITH A SITUATION
THAT IS IMPOSSIBLE TO

00:23:11.500 --> 00:23:14.667
UNDERSTAND, NEVER MIND ACCEPT.

00:23:14.667 --> 00:23:18.600
IMMEDIATELY AFTER THE SHELTER IN
PLACE WAS LIVED BY THE GOVERNOR

00:23:18.600 --> 00:23:23.100
ON APRIL 19, THIS PLACE BECAME A
MEMORIAL.

00:23:23.100 --> 00:23:26.400
PEOPLE IN AND OUTSIDE OF THE
INSTITUTE WERE CALLED TO THE

00:23:26.400 --> 00:23:31.567
SITE OF SEAN'S DEATH TO MAKE
SENSE OF A TRAGEDY THAT MADE NO

00:23:31.567 --> 00:23:32.800
SENSE.

00:23:32.800 --> 00:23:38.933
STUFFED ANIMALS OF EVERY VARIETY
AND FLOWERS AND LETTERS, AND

00:23:38.933 --> 00:23:45.400
CARDS AND PICTURES AND THE
OCCASIONAL BASEBALL CAP WERE THE

00:23:45.400 --> 00:23:51.367
ATTEMPTS FROM SO MANY PEOPLE
TRYING TO MANIFEST THEIR

00:23:51.367 --> 00:23:56.333
FEELINGS IN TANGIBLE FORM, WHILE
ASKING THE SAME QUESTION, WHY.

00:23:56.333 --> 00:24:12.700
AS WEEKS AND MONTHS WENT BY,
THIS TEMPORARY REMEMBRANCE WAS

00:24:12.700 --> 00:24:14.733
WOVEN INTO THE FAMILY OF MIT.

00:24:14.733 --> 00:24:20.933
AND ALL HOURS OF THE SACRED
NIGHT, GROUPS CAME ALONE OR

00:24:20.933 --> 00:24:30.333
HOLDING HANDS, AND DEEP IN
THOUGHT AND EYES DOWN AND

00:24:30.333 --> 00:24:32.267
THOUGHTS ONLY TO THEM THEY CAME.

00:24:32.267 --> 00:24:34.633
ONE COMMON THOUGHT, TO REMEMBER.

00:24:34.633 --> 00:24:37.733
MANY KNEW SEAN BUT MOST DID NOT.

00:24:37.733 --> 00:24:39.367
FOR THEY CAME OUT OF RESPECT.

00:24:39.367 --> 00:24:43.100
TO PRAY AND FIND COMFORT IN THE
PRESENCE OF OTHERS.

00:24:43.100 --> 00:24:48.033
IT WAS ALL WE HAD, AND IT SERVED
US WELL, FOR PROVIDED A SENSE OF

00:24:48.033 --> 00:24:51.367
STABILITY IN THOSE SAD AND
UNCERTAIN TIMES.

00:24:51.367 --> 00:24:56.467
BUT NOW WE HAVE MORE, SO VERY
MUCH MORE.

00:24:56.467 --> 00:24:58.767
SOMETHING BEYOND ALL OF OUR
EXPECTATIONS.

00:24:58.767 --> 00:25:02.867
HOWEVER WE MUST UNDERSTAND THAT
THIS WONDERFUL MEMORIAL THAT WE

00:25:02.867 --> 00:25:08.967
DEDICATE TODAY IS NOT MEANT TO
REPLACE WHAT WAS SPONTANEOUS BY

00:25:08.967 --> 00:25:13.900
THE LOVE OF THE COMMUNITY BUT
CONTINUATION OF THAT LOVE IN A

00:25:13.900 --> 00:25:14.700
PERMANENT FORM.

00:25:14.700 --> 00:25:21.900
MY FATHER WAS BORN IN A CITY
NEAR ITALY, 87 MILES OUTSIDE OF

00:25:21.900 --> 00:25:26.567
ROME, AND THOUGH SMALL IN SIZE
IT'S LARGE IN HISTORY.

00:25:26.567 --> 00:25:30.967
I REMEMBER VIVIDLY THE FIRST
TIME I VISITED THERE WITH MY

00:25:30.967 --> 00:25:38.600
DAD, JULY, 1963, AS WE ENTERED
THE OUTSKIRTS OF THE TOWN IN A

00:25:38.600 --> 00:25:46.333
FIAT 500 AND BLOWING SMOKE, I
WAS STRUCK BY THE SUN'S

00:25:46.333 --> 00:25:51.267
UNDERSTATED MAJESTY AND SENSE OF
POWER AND PURPOSE, AND ABOVE ALL

00:25:51.267 --> 00:25:58.100
THE STRENGTH AND PERMANENCY THAT
THIS STRUCTURE RADIATED.

00:25:58.100 --> 00:26:04.233
WITH MY EYES STRUCK ON THIS
OBJECT OF WONDER, I ASKED MY

00:26:04.233 --> 00:26:05.333
FATHER WHAT WAS THAT.

00:26:05.333 --> 00:26:20.433
HE RESPONDED THAT IS A SITE
BUILT AS A MEMORIAL.

00:26:20.433 --> 00:26:28.833
MANY ARCHITECTS AND BUILDERS
MEMORIALS REMAIN WITH US TODAY,

00:26:28.833 --> 00:26:33.300
AND THOSE THAT DON'T, FELL BY
THE HANDS OF MAN.

00:26:33.300 --> 00:26:40.467
BUT HOWEVER WE HAVE SOMETHING
THAT THE ROMANS DIDN'T HAVE, A

00:26:40.467 --> 00:26:53.200
MEEJIN YOON AND JOHN OCHSENDORF
AND MIT.

00:26:53.200 --> 00:26:58.900
THIS UNSPOKEN SENSE OF PURPOSE
AND CHARACTER AND ONE OF A KIND

00:26:58.900 --> 00:27:04.867
UNIQUENESS REPRESENTS THE
ESSENCE OF WHO SEAN WAS AND WHAT

00:27:04.867 --> 00:27:07.667
HE STOOD FOR.

00:27:07.667 --> 00:27:14.133
YOU HAVE SURPASSED WHAT WE
EXPECTED.

00:27:14.133 --> 00:27:19.833
AND YOU HAVE GIVEN US MORE, WITH
THIS MEMORIAL YOU HAVE GIVEN US

00:27:19.833 --> 00:27:24.533
THE STRENGTH AND COURAGE TO PASS
TO HOPE AND OPTIMISM AND LIVE

00:27:24.533 --> 00:27:27.933
OUR LIVES IN THE MANNER THAT
SEAN DID EVERY DAY.

00:27:27.933 --> 00:27:34.033
WE WILL CRY LESS AND SMILE MORE,
BUT WE ALWAYS REMEMBER.

00:27:34.033 --> 00:27:41.833
SARAH FERI, A GRADUATE STUDENT
HERE AT MIT AND A FRIEND OF

00:27:41.833 --> 00:27:50.233
SEAN'S, SAID AT THE MEMORIAL
SITE, I WILL NOT SAD WHEN I COME

00:27:50.233 --> 00:27:51.933
HERE, THIS MAKES ME HAPPY.

00:27:51.933 --> 00:27:56.867
THIS IS THE SENSE OF THIS
MEMORIAL.

00:27:56.867 --> 00:28:02.233
I HAVE NO DOUBT IN THE YEARS TO
FOLLOW, WHEN WE ARE LONG GONE,

00:28:02.233 --> 00:28:06.867
OTHERS WILL LOOK AT THIS
STRUCTURE, THIS WAS BUILT BY MIT

00:28:06.867 --> 00:28:12.100
TO HONOR SEAN COLLIER, AND TO
MIT, HE WAS A GREAT MAN.

00:28:12.100 --> 00:28:22.367
IT'S MY PRIDE TO INTRODUCE YOU
TO PROFESSOR MEEJIN YOON.

00:28:22.367 --> 00:28:35.133
[APPLAUSE]

00:28:35.133 --> 00:28:40.567
THE DESIGN OF THE PERMANENT
MEMORIAL FOR OFFICER SEAN

00:28:40.567 --> 00:28:44.367
COLLIER HAS BEEN A DEEPLY
EMOTIONAL AND HUMBLING

00:28:44.367 --> 00:28:44.900
EXPERIENCE.

00:28:44.900 --> 00:28:48.400
THE COLLIER MEMORIAL IS MANY
THINGS AT ONCE.

00:28:48.400 --> 00:28:49.733
A SYMBOL.

00:28:49.733 --> 00:28:50.600
A STRUCTURE.

00:28:50.600 --> 00:28:52.467
A SPACE.

00:28:52.467 --> 00:28:57.667
AS A SYMBOL IT REPRESENTS SEAN'S
SERVICE AND SACRIFICE.

00:28:57.667 --> 00:29:02.633
A FIVE-POINTED FIGURE, A STAR,
AND OPEN HAND.

00:29:02.633 --> 00:29:08.333
AS A STRUCTURE IT TRANSLATES
COLLIER STRONG INTO A LITERAL

00:29:08.333 --> 00:29:11.533
STRUCTURE OF STRENGTH THROUGH
UNITY.

00:29:11.533 --> 00:29:27.400
WITH 32 UNIQUE, SOLID GRANITE
BLOCKS TO FORM A FIVE-WAY VAULT.

00:29:27.400 --> 00:29:31.733
AS A SPACE, A CENTRAL VOID, A
PLACE OF PAUSE.

00:29:31.733 --> 00:29:36.233
AND AN OPEN YET SHELTERED
OUT-DOOR ROOM TO REMEMBER AND

00:29:36.233 --> 00:29:38.000
REFLECT.

00:29:38.000 --> 00:29:44.700
IT IS A SOLID AND A VOID, HEAVY
AND LIGHT, SIMPLE AND COMPLEX.

00:29:44.700 --> 00:29:46.700
A GATEWAY AND A WINDOW.

00:29:46.700 --> 00:29:51.400
A ROCK GARDEN AND A MIRROR OF
THE NIGHT SKY.

00:29:51.400 --> 00:29:56.467
AND WHILE I HOPE IT BECOMES MANY
THINGS TO MANY PEOPLE.

00:29:56.467 --> 00:30:01.133
THE ONE THING THAT CUTS ACROSS
ALL OF THESE METAPHORS AND

00:30:01.133 --> 00:30:04.467
REPRESENTATIONS IS THAT IT IS
TRULY MIT.

00:30:04.467 --> 00:30:07.733
IN EVERY WAY.

00:30:07.733 --> 00:30:14.833
IN ITS APPROACH, IN ITS PROCESS,
AND IN ITS APPLICATION AND

00:30:14.833 --> 00:30:16.467
VALUES AND ASPIRATIONS.

00:30:16.467 --> 00:30:26.300
THE MEMORIAL PROJECT BROUGHT
TOGETHER ACROSS CAMPUS OVER 100

00:30:26.300 --> 00:30:26.700
PEOPLE.

00:30:26.700 --> 00:30:31.333
AND THEIR TALENTS AND SKILLS AND
CARE TOGETHER TO SHAPE AND FORM

00:30:31.333 --> 00:30:35.600
AND BUILD THE SPECIAL PLACE FOR
THE REMEMBRANCE FOR SEAN.

00:30:35.600 --> 00:30:41.833
FROM THE COLLIER COMMITTEES FROM
POLICE OFFICERS AND STUDENT AND

00:30:41.833 --> 00:30:43.167
STAFF AND FACULTY.

00:30:43.167 --> 00:30:47.700
TO THE MIT MANAGEMENT TEAM TO
THE DESIGN AND CONSTRUCTION

00:30:47.700 --> 00:30:54.333
TEAMS AND TO MY COLLEAGUES JOHN
OCHSENDORF, AND TO THE STUDENTS

00:30:54.333 --> 00:30:56.967
ACROSS THE DEGREE PROGRAMS AT
MIT.

00:30:56.967 --> 00:31:02.267
I HAVE NEVER EXPERIENCED SUCH AN
INCREDIBLE TEAM, THE LEVEL OF

00:31:02.267 --> 00:31:08.767
RESPECT, DEDICATION AND CARE
THAT WENT ABOVE AND BEYOND.

00:31:08.767 --> 00:31:11.633
THE PROJECT STRETCHED ALL OF US.

00:31:11.633 --> 00:31:15.033
AND YET BROUGHT OUT THE BEST IN
EVERYONE.

00:31:15.033 --> 00:31:17.467
AND HOW COULD IT NOT?

00:31:17.467 --> 00:31:23.767
WITH SEAN'S OWN BROTHER, ROB, ON
THE SITE DAILY AT THE CRACK OF

00:31:23.767 --> 00:31:24.367
DAWN.

00:31:24.367 --> 00:31:31.900
THROUGH BLIZZARD AFTER BLIZZARD,
DEVOTED AND RESOLVED TO BUILD

00:31:31.900 --> 00:31:37.800
BLOCK BY BLOCK TODAY'S MEMORIAL.

00:31:37.800 --> 00:31:42.200
IT MUST HAVE BEEN INCREDIBLY
HARD TO WORK SO CLOSE AT THE

00:31:42.200 --> 00:31:44.533
SITE WHERE SEAN WAS KILLED.

00:31:44.533 --> 00:31:49.267
BUT ROB ALWAYS HAD A KIND SPIRIT
AND CONTAGIOUS SMILE.

00:31:49.267 --> 00:31:54.233
AND WHILE NO PHYSICAL STRUCTURE
COULD FULLY REPRESENT THE

00:31:54.233 --> 00:31:59.333
FULLNESS OF SEAN'S LIFE AND
MEANING OF HIS LOSS.

00:31:59.333 --> 00:32:03.600
FOR THOSE OF US THAT HAD AN
OPPORTUNITY TO LEARN ABOUT SEAN

00:32:03.600 --> 00:32:10.167
THROUGH ROB AND JOHN AND SARAH
AND KEVIN AND CHRIS AND SALLY, I

00:32:10.167 --> 00:32:12.667
CAN ONLY SAY IT WAS TRULY AN
HONOR.

00:32:12.667 --> 00:32:17.400
THE MEMORIAL IN MANY WAYS WAS A
RACE AGAINST TIME TO BUILD A

00:32:17.400 --> 00:32:19.567
TIMELESS STRUCTURE.

00:32:19.567 --> 00:32:21.233
CONCEPTUALLY RICH.

00:32:21.233 --> 00:32:27.733
FORMALLY PRECISE AND TECHNICALLY
UNPRECEDENTED.

00:32:27.733 --> 00:32:32.567
A FEW WEEKS AGO ON ATTEMPTS AND
COLD DAY, 30 STUDENTS AND MASONS

00:32:32.567 --> 00:32:38.900
AND ARCHITECTS AND ENGINEERS
WERE CRAWLING ON TOP AND

00:32:38.900 --> 00:32:42.233
UNDERNEATH AND AROUND THE
MEMORIAL.

00:32:42.233 --> 00:32:48.667
FRANTICALLY CHECKING GAUGES AND
SCALES AND LAPTOPS AS EVERYONE

00:32:48.667 --> 00:32:54.967
READY TO LOWER THE SCALPEL.

00:32:54.967 --> 00:32:56.633
IT WAS A MOMENT OF TRUTH.

00:32:56.633 --> 00:33:20.900
AS THE MASONS IN SYNCHRONY
TURNED THE DIALS OF THE SCAFFOLD

00:33:20.900 --> 00:33:25.733
LOWERED IN MILLIMETERS FOR
HOURS, I REMEMBER AS THE

00:33:25.733 --> 00:33:28.500
STRUCTURE AND THE FORCES MOVED
INTO THE LEGS.

00:33:28.500 --> 00:33:31.000
AND EVERYONE CHEERED.

00:33:31.000 --> 00:33:34.833
I REMEMBER FEELING A SENSE OF
RELIEF.

00:33:34.833 --> 00:33:39.800
BUT ALSO A MOMENT OF PROFOUND
REALIZATION.

00:33:39.800 --> 00:33:45.733
THAT THE MEMORIAL HAD NOT BEEN
BUILT REALLY WITH BIG GRANITE

00:33:45.733 --> 00:33:46.167
BLOCKS.

00:33:46.167 --> 00:33:51.033
BUT HAD IN FACT REALLY BEEN
BUILT WITH BIG HEARTS AND ALL

00:33:51.033 --> 00:33:54.400
LOVE.

00:33:54.400 --> 00:34:51.333
[APPLAUSE]

00:34:51.333 --> 00:34:57.467
♪
LIVE ON WHAT YOU WOULD, BIG

00:34:57.467 --> 00:34:58.100
SMILES.

00:34:58.100 --> 00:34:59.233
BIG HEART.

00:34:59.233 --> 00:35:01.633
BIG SERVICE, ALL LOVE.

00:35:01.633 --> 00:35:13.667
OFFICER SEAN COLLIER WE LOVE
YOU.

00:35:13.667 --> 00:35:18.767
THE INSTITUTE CAN BE THE
COMMITTEE TO THINK ABOUT A

00:35:18.767 --> 00:35:23.400
MEMORIAL FOR SEAN COLLIER.

00:35:23.400 --> 00:35:29.733
THE FIGURE OF THE MEMORIAL IS A
KIND OF FIVE-WALL STRUCTURE

00:35:29.733 --> 00:35:30.267
EXTRUDED.

00:35:30.267 --> 00:35:33.800
AND THEN A VOID IS ACTUALLY
CARVED OUT OF IT.

00:35:33.800 --> 00:35:37.733
AND THAT VOID REPRESENTS A KIND
OF ABSENCE OR LOSS.

00:35:37.733 --> 00:35:43.900
THE FORM ITSELF IS BASED ON THE
HAND REPRESENTING BOTH A KIND OF

00:35:43.900 --> 00:35:46.167
GESTURE OF OPENNESS TO OTHERS.

00:35:46.167 --> 00:35:52.300
BUT ALSO THE ABILITY TO APPLY
ONE'S SELF TO MAKE THINGS

00:35:52.300 --> 00:35:55.233
BETTER.

00:35:55.233 --> 00:36:00.333
WE WANTED THE STONE TO BE
REPRESENTATIVE OF THE PLACES

00:36:00.333 --> 00:36:08.100
WHERE SEAN SPENT A LOT OF TIME,
LIKE THE MIT OUTING CLUB, SO WE

00:36:08.100 --> 00:36:10.333
THOUGHT OF GRANITE, NEW
HAMPSHIRE.

00:36:10.333 --> 00:36:16.167
THE MEMORIAL IS MADE OF 32
BLOCKS WHICH PIECE TOGETHER IN A

00:36:16.167 --> 00:36:20.467
WAY THAT ALLOWS EACH BLOCK TO
HOLD THE OTHER ONE UP.

00:36:20.467 --> 00:36:23.633
I WILL GO AROUND AND GET THE
OTHER TWO.

00:36:23.633 --> 00:36:26.633
SO IT'S STRENGTH COMES FROM
UNITY.

00:36:26.633 --> 00:36:32.267
ITS STRENGTH COMES FROM THE
MANY, AS OPPOSED TO A SINGULAR

00:36:32.267 --> 00:36:33.333
STRUCTURE.

00:36:33.333 --> 00:36:36.967
PEOPLE DON'T BUILD ANYMORE
THIS WAY.

00:36:36.967 --> 00:36:42.033
SO IT'S AN EXPERIMENT IN USING
REALLY OLD-FASHIONED TECHNIQUES

00:36:42.033 --> 00:36:45.500
OF STONE MASONRY.

00:36:45.500 --> 00:36:51.300
SORT OF PRE-MODEL BUT USING
HIGH-END COMPUTERS FOR THE

00:36:51.300 --> 00:36:53.533
SHAPES AND LAY-OUT OF THE
STONES.

00:36:53.533 --> 00:36:58.233
WE ARE SAYING THIS IS A-1,
IT'S GREAT, IT'S PERFECT.

00:36:58.233 --> 00:37:04.000
THE FIVE WALLS ACTUALLY
EXTEND OUT FROM THE CENTRAL

00:37:04.000 --> 00:37:04.367
VOID.

00:37:04.367 --> 00:37:09.200
AS THEY EXTEND OUT THEY FRAME
VERY SPECIFIC VIEWS.

00:37:09.200 --> 00:37:13.867
THE TWO WALLS CLOSEST
TOGETHER ALIGN WITH A LOCATION

00:37:13.867 --> 00:37:18.000
OF SEAN'S CRUISER WHERE HE WAS
SHOT.

00:37:18.000 --> 00:37:22.100
IT'S THE MOST INTIMATE SPACE IN
THE MEMORIAL.

00:37:22.100 --> 00:37:25.567
WHEN YOU WERE UNDER IT FRAMES
EXACTLY THAT SPOT WHERE THE

00:37:25.567 --> 00:37:27.667
TRAGEDY OCCURRED.

00:37:27.667 --> 00:37:34.500
WHAT WE REALLY HAVE IS FIVE
HALF ARCHES EACH LEANING IN

00:37:34.500 --> 00:37:35.567
TOWARDS THE MIDDLE.

00:37:35.567 --> 00:37:40.333
WHILE THAT HALF ARCH SHOULD FALL
OVER, THERE IS ANOTHER HALF ARCH

00:37:40.333 --> 00:37:48.400
SOMEWHERE ELSE LEANING IN AND
ANOTHER HALF ARCH, EACH ARE

00:37:48.400 --> 00:37:50.733
COMING TOGETHER IN THE MIDDLE.

00:37:50.733 --> 00:37:58.033
AND THE FIVE WALLS ARE A
BUTTRESSING THE CENTER PART OF A

00:37:58.033 --> 00:37:59.600
VERY PLAT VAULT.

00:37:59.600 --> 00:38:06.033
AS THE ARCHES PUSH OUT WARDS ON
THE WALLS, THE WALLS WANT TO

00:38:06.033 --> 00:38:10.467
SPREAD OUT, AND BURIED
UNDERGROUND IS A CENTRAL TIE

00:38:10.467 --> 00:38:15.367
PULLING TOWARDS THE CENTER AND
PULLING THE WHOLE MEMORIAL

00:38:15.367 --> 00:38:22.633
TOGETHER SO IT'S AN EQUILIBRIUM.

00:38:22.633 --> 00:38:27.600
AND THERE IS A FORM IN THE
CONCRETE WITH STEEL EMBEDDED IN

00:38:27.600 --> 00:38:34.233
THE CONCRETE TO ENSURE THAT THE
WALLS WILL NOT MOVE OUTWARD OVER

00:38:34.233 --> 00:38:35.367
THE CENTURIES.

00:38:35.367 --> 00:38:38.733
THE OUTSIDE OF THE STRUCTURE
IS A FLAMED SURFACE.

00:38:38.733 --> 00:38:43.933
THIS IS A FINE GRAIN AND DENSE
GRANITE, BUT LEAVES A FLAT BUT

00:38:43.933 --> 00:38:50.367
MORE TEXTURED SURFACE.

00:38:50.367 --> 00:38:54.867
EACH STONE IS CUT WITH
ADVANCED MILLING TECHNOLOGY AND

00:38:54.867 --> 00:38:59.033
SOME STONES ARE CUT BY ROBOTS.

00:38:59.033 --> 00:39:04.100
AND THE ACCURACY OF EACH STONE
IS WITHIN ONE MILLIMETER.

00:39:04.100 --> 00:39:08.267
EVEN AS THE ROBOT IS CARVING
THE BLOCKS, SOMEONE HAS TO TAP

00:39:08.267 --> 00:39:13.567
EVERY SINGLE PIECE AND BREAK IT
OFF ONE BY ONE, BEFORE THE ROBOT

00:39:13.567 --> 00:39:16.167
CAN COME IN FOR ITS FINAL PASS.

00:39:16.167 --> 00:39:19.800
IT WAS A KIND OF INCREDIBLE
DANCE BETWEEN LIKE MACHINE AND

00:39:19.800 --> 00:39:28.433
MAN TO CARVE THESE PIECES.

00:39:28.433 --> 00:39:40.000
IT'S LIKE A THREE-DIMENSIONAL
JIGSAW PUZZLE WITH FINELY

00:39:40.000 --> 00:39:41.733
POLISHED BLOCKS GRANITE.

00:39:41.733 --> 00:39:45.800
BUT IN THIS CASE THEY WAY 10,000
EACH.

00:39:45.800 --> 00:39:53.733
I AM ROB ROGERS, A PROJECT
MANAGER FOR SUFFOLK CONSTRUCTION

00:39:53.733 --> 00:39:56.400
AND ALL SEAN COLLIER'S BROTHER.

00:39:56.400 --> 00:40:00.533
THERE A SEQUENCE OF HOW WE LOWER
THE STONES.

00:40:00.533 --> 00:40:06.000
THE STONES SHOULD LOCK IN PLACE.

00:40:06.000 --> 00:40:10.200
WHEN THE FIRST BLOCKS ARRIVED
AND STARTED TO TAKE PHYSICAL

00:40:10.200 --> 00:40:14.233
FORM, AS AN ARCHITECT THAT'S A
MAGICAL MOMENT.

00:40:14.233 --> 00:40:20.333
WHEN A CONCEPT TURNS INTO
PHYSICAL REALITY.

00:40:20.333 --> 00:40:25.000
THERE WERE MANY TIMES IN THIS
WHOLE PROJECT WHERE WE HAD TO

00:40:25.000 --> 00:40:30.900
KEEP OUR EMOTIONS IN CHECK.

00:40:30.900 --> 00:40:34.900
BECAUSE IT WAS SUCH AN
EMOTIONAL PROJECT FOR EVERYONE

00:40:34.900 --> 00:40:37.433
INVOLVED.

00:40:37.433 --> 00:40:44.500
IT'S BEEN A VERY HUMBLING
FEELING, YOU KNOW, IN THE PAST

00:40:44.500 --> 00:40:48.900
ALMOST TWO YEARS SINCE SEAN IS
GONE.

00:40:48.900 --> 00:40:52.800
IT'S HELPED A LOT.

00:40:52.800 --> 00:41:02.200
WE STARTED WITH THE KEYSTONE
AND WE HAD TO BUILD A TEMPORARY

00:41:02.200 --> 00:41:06.300
SCALPEL UNDER THAT KEYSTONE AND
THEN THE RING STONES CAME IN

00:41:06.300 --> 00:41:11.967
NEXT, AND WE SEQUENTIALLY WENT
THROUGH EACH OF THE FIVE LEGS.

00:41:11.967 --> 00:41:15.800
AS PROBABLY THE HARDEST
SEASON TO BUILD IN.

00:41:15.800 --> 00:41:20.933
WE HAVE 109 INCHES, WORSE
WINTER EVER IN BOSTON.

00:41:20.933 --> 00:41:22.367
IT'S MORE CHALLENGING.

00:41:22.367 --> 00:41:25.200
BUT EVERYONE ON SITE WAS GREAT.

00:41:25.200 --> 00:41:30.767
WE KNEW WE HAD AN END DATE AND
WE NEED TO MEET THIS DATE.

00:41:30.767 --> 00:41:33.433
SO GUYS WORKED HARDER AND
LONGER.

00:41:33.433 --> 00:41:37.600
THE MOST EXCITING MOMENT AND
THE MOST CRITICAL MOMENT IN THE

00:41:37.600 --> 00:41:45.400
CONSTRUCTION IS WHEN WE LOWERED
THE SCAFFOLDING AND THE KEYSTONE

00:41:45.400 --> 00:41:54.567
AND THE VAULT GO INTO THE FIVE
WALLS FOR THE FIRST TIME.

00:41:54.567 --> 00:42:02.567
WE HAD INSTRUMENTS FOR
PLACEMENT IF 25 DIFFERENT

00:42:02.567 --> 00:42:06.667
LOCATIONS AND SCALES TO DO
REAL-TIME MEASUREMENTS OF HOW

00:42:06.667 --> 00:42:09.200
THE LOAD IS TRANSFERRED.

00:42:09.200 --> 00:42:12.033
WE WILL START WITH THE THREE
MIDDLE ONES.

00:42:12.033 --> 00:42:16.000
AS WE LOWER THE TEMPORARY
SUPPORTS AND THEY COME DOWN, THE

00:42:16.000 --> 00:42:18.067
LOAD ON THE SCALE SHOULD COME
DOWN.

00:42:18.067 --> 00:42:22.400
AND THE LOAD ON THE SCALES ARE
GOING DOWN BECAUSE THE WEIGHT OF

00:42:22.400 --> 00:42:23.800
THE STONES ARE GOING ON ARCHING.

00:42:23.800 --> 00:42:27.967
IF WE LOWER THE SUPPORTS AND THE
READING ON THE SCALE DOESN'T

00:42:27.967 --> 00:42:33.633
CHANGE, THAT'S BAD.

00:42:33.633 --> 00:42:37.200
ONE
TWO

00:42:37.200 --> 00:42:38.067
THREE.

00:42:38.067 --> 00:42:40.100
WOW, BABY.

00:42:40.100 --> 00:42:41.300
THAT'S GREAT.

00:42:41.300 --> 00:42:45.000
[APPLAUSE]

00:42:45.000 --> 00:42:50.267
SO BEHIND "B" LEG IS A LITTLE
PART OF MY SPEECH THAT I GAVE

00:42:50.267 --> 00:42:51.567
FOR SEAN.

00:42:51.567 --> 00:42:56.467
SO THEY ENGRAVED IT ON TO THE
STONE.

00:42:56.467 --> 00:43:01.833
SO LIVE LONG LIKE HE WOULD, BIG
HEARTS AND BIG SMILES AND BIG

00:43:01.833 --> 00:43:03.100
SERVICE, ALL LOVE.

00:43:03.100 --> 00:43:09.167
HE WAS A KID THAT LOVED, AND HAD
A MILLION KIDS.

00:43:09.167 --> 00:43:13.133
I DON'T KNOW HOW HE SLEPT,
ALWAYS DOING SOMETHING AND

00:43:13.133 --> 00:43:15.167
HANGING OUT WITH SOMEBODY.

00:43:15.167 --> 00:43:21.000
REALLY LIVED LIFE TO ITS
FULLEST.

00:43:21.000 --> 00:43:24.500
HE WAS MADE TO BE A POLICE
OFFICER, I KNOW THAT HIS MOTHER

00:43:24.500 --> 00:43:27.467
SAID THAT HE WANTED TO BE A
POLICEMEN FROM THE TIME HE WAS

00:43:27.467 --> 00:43:28.567
SEVEN YEARS OLD.

00:43:28.567 --> 00:43:33.233
AND IT SHOWED, IT SHOWED IN
EVERYTHING HE DID, HE GOT IT.

00:43:33.233 --> 00:43:37.067
IT'S A VERY OPEN STRUCTURE
FOR SOMETHING BUILT OUT OF SUCH

00:43:37.067 --> 00:43:40.633
SOLID STONE, AND IT'S TO BE A
GATEWAY INTO CAMPUS.

00:43:40.633 --> 00:43:44.300
THERE ARE PEOPLE MILLING AROUND
AND SPEND TIME OUTSIDE.

00:43:44.300 --> 00:43:48.433
SO WE HAVE THESE BENCHES AND
THERE WILL BE TREES.

00:43:48.433 --> 00:43:53.633
AND IT HOPEFULLY WILL BE A PLACE
THAT HE ENJOYS SITTING DOWN AND

00:43:53.633 --> 00:43:55.933
SPENDING TIME WITH THEIR FRIENDS
AND THE COMMUNITY.

00:43:55.933 --> 00:44:01.167
I HOPE THAT THE MEMORIAL WILL
BECOME ONE OF THE BELOVED

00:44:01.167 --> 00:44:03.200
ELEMENTS ON CAMPUS.

00:44:03.200 --> 00:44:08.167
HOPEFULLY IT CAN REMAIN FOR US
TO REMEMBER SEAN'S SERVICE AND

00:44:08.167 --> 00:44:10.100
THE COMING TOGETHER OF THE
COMMUNITY.

00:44:10.100 --> 00:44:25.233
AND OUR VALUES.

00:44:25.233 --> 00:44:48.433
[APPLAUSE]

00:44:48.433 --> 00:44:53.100
MEEJIN, JOHN AND ROB, MEMBERS OF
THE PROJECT TEAM AND THE

00:44:53.100 --> 00:44:56.600
PERMANENT COLLIER MEMORIAL.

00:44:56.600 --> 00:44:59.033
THANK YOU VERY MUCH FROM THE
BOTTOM OF MY HEART AND FROM

00:44:59.033 --> 00:45:00.867
EVERYONE IN THE COMMUNITY.

00:45:00.867 --> 00:45:10.133
I WOULD LIKE TO THANK DR. ERICA
FUNKHOUSER AND OUR STUDENTS FOR

00:45:10.133 --> 00:45:19.333
HONORING SEAN WITH THEIR
BEAUTIFUL POEM--THE WORDS TO

00:45:19.333 --> 00:45:28.467
WHICH ARE AVAILABLE AT THE
ENTRANCES TO THE TENT--ALL OF

00:45:28.467 --> 00:45:37.667
TODAY'S SPEAKERS, BILL CUTTER
AND THE MEMBERS OF MIT'S CHAMBER

00:45:37.667 --> 00:45:46.867
CHORUS AND CONCERT CHOIR, AND
OUR COMMUNITY FOR GATHERING TO

00:45:46.867 --> 00:45:56.067
DEDICATE THIS EXTRAORDINARY
MEMORIAL WITH THOSE WHO MADE IT

00:45:56.067 --> 00:46:00.667
POSSIBLE.

00:46:00.667 --> 00:46:09.933
I INVITE YOU NOW TO JOIN ME IN A
MOMENT OF SILENCE TO REMEMBER

00:46:09.933 --> 00:46:14.600
OFFICER COLLIER.

00:46:14.600 --> 00:46:16.767
THANK YOU.

00:46:16.767 --> 00:46:21.100
PLEASE RISE FOR THE BENEDICTION
BY RABBI FISHER AND REMAIN

00:46:21.100 --> 00:46:25.467
STANDING FOR THE OPENING OF THE
MEMORIAL, AFTER WHICH, I INVITE

00:46:25.467 --> 00:46:29.833
YOU TO JOIN US FOR A COMMUNITY
PICNIC AND TO EXPERIENCE THE MIT

00:46:29.833 --> 00:46:32.033
MEMORIAL TO OFFICER COLLIER.

00:46:32.033 --> 00:46:36.700
FOR EVERYTHING THERE IS A
SEASON,     

00:46:36.700 --> 00:46:41.367
A TIME FOR EVERY ACTIVITY UNDER
HEAVEN.

00:46:41.367 --> 00:46:46.033
 A TIME TO BE BORN AND A TIME TO
DIE.

00:46:46.033 --> 00:46:50.700
A TIME TO PLANT AND A TIME TO
PLUCK UP THAT WHICH IS PLANTED.

00:46:50.700 --> 00:46:55.333
A TIME TO BREAK DOWN AND A TIME
TO BUILD UP.

00:46:55.333 --> 00:47:00.000
A TIME TO WEEP AND A TIME TO
LAUGH.

00:47:00.000 --> 00:47:04.733
A TIME TO MOURN AND A TIME TO
DANCE.

00:47:04.733 --> 00:47:09.400
A TIME TO SCATTER STONES AND A
TIME TO GATHER STONES.

00:47:09.400 --> 00:47:14.067
A TIME TO EMBRACE AND A TIME TO
REFRAIN FROM EMBRACING.

00:47:14.067 --> 00:47:18.700
A TIME TO SEEK AND A TIME TO
LOSE.

00:47:18.700 --> 00:47:23.300
A TIME TO KEEP AND A TIME TO
CAST AWAY.

00:47:23.300 --> 00:47:28.167
A TIME TO TEAR AND A TIME TO
MEND.

00:47:28.167 --> 00:47:30.167
EXCERPTED FROM ECCLESIASTES 3.

00:47:30.167 --> 00:47:34.167
AS WE HAVE ALREADY HEARD TODAY,
DURING THESE PAST TWO YEARS, WE

00:47:34.167 --> 00:47:38.167
HAVE RUN THE GAMUT OF THESE ACTS
AND EMOTIONS.

00:47:38.167 --> 00:47:42.167
THE ATTACK AT THE MARATHON, AND
THE MURDER OF OFFICER COLLIER

00:47:42.167 --> 00:47:46.167
SHOOK US -- SHOOK BOSTON,
CAMBRIDGE, MIT.

00:47:46.167 --> 00:47:50.167
WE LEARNED HOW VULNERABLE WE
ARE, SO MORE THAN WE IMAGINED.

00:47:50.167 --> 00:47:54.167
WE LEARNED ABOUT HATE, BASELESS
HATRED THAT COULD TAKE LIVES,

00:47:54.167 --> 00:47:58.167
INCLUDING THE LIFE OF ONE SO
DEVOTED, SO CHEERFUL, AND SO

00:47:58.167 --> 00:48:00.167
FULL OF CARE.

00:48:00.167 --> 00:48:04.233
AND, WE ALSO LEARNED WE ARE
STRONGER THAN WE EVER IMAGINED.

00:48:04.233 --> 00:48:08.233
WE CAME TOGETHER AS A COMMUNITY;
WE STOOD STRONG.

00:48:08.233 --> 00:48:12.233
HEROES LIKE SEAN GAVE US
REMINDERS OF COMPASSION,

00:48:12.233 --> 00:48:19.667
DEDICATION, KINDNESS; AN EXAMPLE
OF HOW TO BE PART OF A

00:48:19.667 --> 00:48:23.600
COMMUNITY, HOW TO BUILD
COMMUNITY, HOW TO CARE FOR A

00:48:23.600 --> 00:48:25.600
COMMUNITY.

00:48:25.600 --> 00:48:29.600
AND, WE HAVE BUILT AND REBUILT
OUT OF THESE EVENTS, THESE

00:48:29.600 --> 00:48:31.600
MEMORIES.

00:48:31.600 --> 00:48:35.600
O GOD, CONTINUE TO BE WITH US AS
WE BUILD, AND CONTINUE TO LET US

00:48:35.600 --> 00:48:37.600
KNOW YOU ARE NEAR.

00:48:37.600 --> 00:48:39.600
O GOD, LET US LIVE IN PEACE.

00:48:39.600 --> 00:48:41.600
HELP US.

00:48:41.600 --> 00:48:45.600
TEACH ALL PEOPLE OF ALL
NATIONALITIES, RACES, AND

00:48:45.600 --> 00:48:49.600
FAITHS, IN ALL COUNTRIES -- IN
ALL CITIES, HERE AND ALL OVER

00:48:49.600 --> 00:48:53.600
THE WORLD, TO BELIEVE THAT
PEACE, THAT SECURITY, WHICH

00:48:53.600 --> 00:49:00.933
OFTEN SEEM SO FAR OFF, ARE, IN
FACT, WITHIN IN OUR REACH.

00:49:00.933 --> 00:49:05.000
OBSTRUCT THE PLANS OF ANY
PLOTTING TO DO HARM TO ANOTHER.

00:49:05.000 --> 00:49:09.000
WATCH OVER US, GOD; WATCH OVER
THIS MEMORIAL.

00:49:09.000 --> 00:49:13.000
WATCH OVER SEAN COLLIER'S FAMILY
AND FRIENDS.

00:49:13.000 --> 00:49:15.000
WATCH OVER YOUR WORLD.

00:49:15.000 --> 00:49:21.533
SHELTER US ALL WITH PEACE.

00:49:21.533 --> 00:49:25.533
SEAN, YOUR LIFE WAS
EXTINGUISHED, BUT YOUR LIGHT CAN

00:49:25.533 --> 00:49:27.533
NEVER BE EXTINGUISHED.

00:49:27.533 --> 00:49:31.533
IT SHINES ON ALL OF US AND
ILLUMINATES OUR WAYS.

00:49:31.533 --> 00:49:33.533
YOU ARE WITH US ALWAYS.

00:49:33.533 --> 00:49:35.533
WE WILL NOT FORGET YOU.

00:49:35.533 --> 00:49:39.533
AS THIS MEMORIAL SERVES AS A
PHYSICAL SIGN, REMINDING US OF

00:49:39.533 --> 00:49:47.300
YOU, AND OF YOUR VALUES:
MAY WE ALL STRIVE WITH ALL OUR

00:49:47.300 --> 00:49:51.300
MIGHT TO LIVE UP TO THE EXAMPLE
YOU HAVE SET.

00:49:51.300 --> 00:49:55.300
MAY WE STRIVE TO FACE EACH DAY
WITH EAGERNESS.

00:49:55.300 --> 00:49:59.300
TO VALUE OUR COMMUNITIES AND OUR
FRIENDS.

00:49:59.300 --> 00:50:05.133
TO TRY TO SEE A FRIEND IN EACH
NEW PERSON WE ENCOUNTER.

00:50:05.133 --> 00:50:09.133
MAY WE SEEK TO GUARD OTHERS, AS
YOU GUARDED US.

00:50:09.133 --> 00:50:15.533
MAY YOUR MEMORY BE WITH US ALONG
ALL OUR PATHS AND OUR WAYS.

00:50:15.533 --> 00:50:17.533
WATCH OVER US, GOD.

00:50:17.533 --> 00:50:19.533
WATCH OVER SEAN.

00:50:19.533 --> 00:50:21.533
WATCH OVER YOUR WORLD.

00:50:21.533 --> 00:50:27.867
SHELTER US ALL WITH PEACE, WITH
LOVE, NOW AND ALWAYS.

00:50:27.867 --> 00:50:30.600
AND LET US SAY, AMEN.

